## Mirror ON/OFF — standing forbid (2026-08-09) — HF-21

**HARD FAIL / NEVER reintroduce.** Mirror ON/OFF is **forbidden** on BLE-MIDI map, Deck glass, soft keys, and K1 BLE facade. Never reintroduce `primary.mirror` / `secondary.mirror`, MIRROR soft keys, Mirror sheet rows, Mirror CC bindings, Deck state TX snapshot fields, or Tab5 glass TX (`sendPrimaryMirror` and kin). No synonym stubs (FLIP/REV/SYM/MIRR).

- Receipt authority: [`_scratch/mirror_purge_ble_20260809/PURGE_RECEIPT.md`](../../_scratch/mirror_purge_ble_20260809/PURGE_RECEIPT.md)
- Internal render flag `CONFIG.MIRROR_ENABLED` may remain.
- K1 USB serial `mirror_enabled=` / `secondary_mirror_enabled=` = **bringup-only** — not a product/Deck/BLE control. Do not toggle device Mirror unless Captain explicitly orders bringup.

